  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons with Autofire (Assault Rifle [Any])</p>\n<p><em>Lightening bolt carriers and enhancing gas flow is not a simple process, but if done correctly, can stabilize even the most basic automatic rifles.</em></p>\n<p>Attaching this attachment requires a DV17 Weaponstech Skill Check. Only one Constant Recoil System may be installed. When installed, the weapon's Autofire (Assault Rifle) is replaced with Autofire (Machine Gun 3), or (Machine Gun 4) if installed into an Excellent Quality weapon.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Edit the weapon's Autofire value and DV table by hand (use the tagged [MG] table if its range table has one).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Internal Components).</em></p>"
